<title>FRANCE: Lagardere requotes sharply lower.</title>
<headline>Lagardere requotes sharply lower.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Lagardere requoted 9.68 percent lower at 140.90 francs after being suspended since the open because of the government's decision to halt the privatisation of Thomson SA.</p>
<p>The stock was meant to requote at 1315 GMT but failed and was suspended limit down.</p>
<p>It then requoted at 1330 and immediately fell to 138.00 francs, over 11 percent lower before rebounding.</p>
<p>At 1336 GMT the stock was at 143.00, off 8.33 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
